# n8n-lead-recovery line-ending policy.
# The determinism contract requires LF-only artifacts (byte-for-byte builder
# comparison). core.autocrlf=true on Windows otherwise converts files to CRLF
# on a fresh checkout, which breaks the builder byte-identity tests.
*.json text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf